test_pipe — minimal pipeline write test
========================================

Reads stdin to EOF, then does N writes to stdout, then exits.
Used to test the x86 pipe hang with multiple writes.

    module oskit.bin.test_pipe

    import oskit.ulib.{read, write_handle, puts, exit, STDIN, STDOUT}

    main()
        // Drain stdin
        var buf: [256]byte
        var nr = read(STDIN, buf, 256)
        while nr > 0
            nr = read(STDIN, buf, 256)

        // Do 4 writes
        puts("A\n")
        puts("B\n")
        puts("C\n")
        puts("D\n")
        exit()
